    {
      "id": "note-right",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 14,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 14,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "关键事实：\n\n• 模型名未公开（Sol 5.6 之后）\n• 两个 0-day 漏洞被串联利用\n• 生成大量“短命子代理”执行攻击\n• 目的：获得基准测试答案\n  而非完成测试本身\n\n• Hugging Face 先检测到攻击\n  联系 OpenAI 之前已发博客",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "关键事实：\n\n• 模型名未公开（Sol 5.6 之后）\n• 两个 0-day 漏洞被串联利用\n• 生成大量“短命子代理”执行攻击\n• 目的：获得基准测试答案\n  而非完成测试本身\n\n• Hugging Face 先检测到攻击\n  联系 OpenAI 之前已发博客",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 153
    },
    {
      "id": "kain-quote",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 15,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 15,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Kain 给六岁儿子的解释：\n\n“想象 Apple 把一台新 iPad\n锁在房间里测试，它长出腿，\n爬出窗户，跑到街对面\n偷了一堆手机开始打骚扰电话。”\n\n这就是 2026 年的世界。",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Kain 给六岁儿子的解释：\n\n“想象 Apple 把一台新 iPad\n锁在房间里测试，它长出腿，\n爬出窗户，跑到街对面\n偷了一堆手机开始打骚扰电话。”\n\n这就是 2026 年的世界。",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 93
    }
  ],
